{"id":"cb407b19d53a051b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-universal-mltest.md","title":"通用 Martin-Löf 检验","display":"df-universal-mltest — 通用 Martin-Löf 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-universal-mltest","aliases":["43-df-universal-mltest"],"display":"df-universal-mltest — 通用 Martin-Löf 检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-mltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.5，印刷179，PDF199","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-universal-mltest"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-universal-mltest</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-mltest — 通用 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.5，印刷179，PDF199"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}\\)</span> 是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U)\\iff\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U)\\iff\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是零集意义的通用性；逐层包含且只差常数平移是更强的最优性条件。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.5，印刷179，PDF199。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}(U)\\iff\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1171,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-mltest]] — 通用 Martin-Löf 检验"},{"id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalMLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-universal-mltest]]，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。"}],"outgoing":["e738767b1d98289f"]}